        -: 2224: * Here A and B arrive in the order HMMA.16816 consumes them (omega_matmul_frag_pack_a / _b):
        -: 2225: *   A block (mt, ks): 512 bytes, lane L at L*16: a0..a7, one LDG.E.128 per step;
        -: 2226: *   B block (nt, ks): 256 bytes, lane L at L*8:  b0..b3, one LDG.E.64 per step;
        -: 2227: * consecutive K steps of one tile are adjacent, so a warp streams its column tile. Each loop
        -: 2228: * pass issues `unroll` steps of loads at immediate offsets (A on SB2, B on SB4), then runs the HMMA
        -: 2229: * chain: every HMMA waits SB2 and SB4 (stall 15) and a NOP (stall 14) follows it, the 29 cycles nvcc
        -: 2230: * puts between dependent HMMA.16816 (omega_blackwell_verify_codegen_fixtures_fragmm).
        -: 2231: * The cursors advance only after the chain, when every load has landed (the HMMAs waited
